        "official_en_sha256": "d39aa4af45864fc471868fc960bf9e5488e26169d800c27dccb4629c0a989d89"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その前に謝らせてくれ。\r\n飛空艇部隊を壊滅させてしまったのは俺の責任だ。\r\n本当にすまない。",
        "official_en": "Well first off, I need to apologize to you. It’s entirely my fault that the squadron was decimated. I’m sorry.",
        "real_en": null
