      "text": {
        "jp": "飛空艇部隊を設立しようとしていた頃は、\r\n毎日のように会ってたんだけどな。",
        "official_en": "It’s crazy to think we used to work together every day when we were setting up the squadron... I really should’ve kept in touch more often.",
        "real_en": "We used to see each other almost every day when we were setting up the squadron."
